", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_956509306819416_6244866727895569936_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VV3LFWoReK0Q7kNvwF5DtFU&_nc_oc=AdofL5SEBNER2OofGIiJn_76v1751pn5ZMi6Y-MNnA6QW_hft1mq2WonK1NDyCykKeg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af08szj7j3c6ccCZx9iMP1q13iD_uLXQsuMUbomvNDV8Xg&oe=69F1FF55"}, {"file_name": "pt-HERO.png", "id": "738787125868038", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821081_738787132534704_331727048836482438_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u7wEcPiAOZgQ7kNvwGIt976&_nc_oc=AdqDgA94GF5_J7nrJVFK8rGGrADCC6AmJj_BG6Gm69GTxSP25jMTp5VCK1HimbSfVtE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1gdonlNUwyQXVR2miEYIUqat0GOsiaTBhfbILgal_JIw&oe=69F21871"}]}, "id": "26277555788561585", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SCREENSHOT-1.png", "id": "1522093209486806", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1522093212820139_782533134582982989_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sWfTe1ObZskQ7kNvwE63X4A&_nc_oc=AdoYCDrc1JLRoGnHYyhcvEBZJfJAtLhJlC2NvmzUoSMje9RDjdqdNO9flCKOVxBOVgk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af31_bQzsCW5Ln2St8j26JrxvNfln8A9jNwuimTqDseF0g&oe=69F217F9"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT-2.png", "id": "917506287840018", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_917506291173351_2587761857790981299_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0fZm7nI61NQQ7kNvwEi_1nb&_nc_oc=Ado3kbVAu_A3wD3uT4RIx_egmadP4WH6GrRpjTY_4_O6zfZ5LI2POanyu5A43JsFEzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0eSPDiW69qa80NftdJx32euRoQ1I-YD8x3xFR-AdhuiQ&oe=69F201EA"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT-3.png", "id": "3024736607732066", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_3024736611065399_1397990661412096722_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G2uPmyxRiscQ7kNvwHzJ_Hu&_nc_oc=AdqqZcbfgGtmkC3lhXS-LMI5TviyapMhnYWn5Yt0NlB14dm_3rF387x3v0vBzm6ba_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0IGZC9b5HSPo4lVRoDYjD6YLfVt9DLsYhRdMsNHvuG-Q&oe=69F1FD60"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT-4.png", "id": "1317449376914116", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822327_1317449380247449_8182018466093444365_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DmylUvsP8PoQ7kNvwHMdU_3&_nc_oc=AdpVX5Vu3M8N6cB8p_laOSRQJMhH5und3KdIcQZRXsf4l1fgcHMGLKddDXUqAVd2j78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3z_sjtkvkFKiYGlPxSRykopz2LLR1hzQm2re9xyMpnDg&oe=69F21303"}, {"file_name": "SCREENSHOT-5.png", "id": "1481950300041115", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_1481950306707781_5783550649487543497_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sR6ZcjCxe2QQ7kNvwGJJ8e6&_nc_oc=Adr_3ALVw8PzQKFoWt6PIa4EBgrkGLBU9wAKpP2Uj0aC9ycBgi0dPK6nXBWWF2CSuGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1K-wFWMoGfguPw7Eeh_5VCOZd6aO1-DF-RR6GI4g8i2Q&oe=69F1F348"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Irispace", "keywords": ["foco", "mem\u00f3ria", "treinamento", "l\u00f3gica", "zen"], "long_description": "Este aplicativo oferece um ambiente imersivo de realidade virtual com sess\u00f5es guiadas voltadas para foco, mem\u00f3ria e racioc\u00ednio l\u00f3gico.\n\nDentro de um espa\u00e7o virtual calmo e organizado, voc\u00ea participa de atividades interativas que estimulam aten\u00e7\u00e3o, organiza\u00e7\u00e3o, reconhecimento de padr\u00f5es e resolu\u00e7\u00e3o de problemas. Cada sess\u00e3o \u00e9 conduzida por um instrutor virtual que explica as tarefas, guia o fluxo da experi\u00eancia e facilita a navega\u00e7\u00e3o entre as atividades.\n\nO aplicativo foi projetado para ser simples, confort\u00e1vel e intuitivo. As atividades acontecem sempre pr\u00f3ximas ao usu\u00e1rio, sem necessidade de locomo\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica, garantindo uma experi\u00eancia segura e acess\u00edvel.\n\nRecursos adicionais podem ser desbloqueados ao criar uma conta em irispace.app, permitindo integrar sess\u00f5es, acessar novas funcionalidades e ampliar a experi\u00eancia ao longo do tempo.\n\nPrincipais recursos:\n\u2022 Sess\u00f5es guiadas\n\u2022 Atividades interativas de foco, mem\u00f3ria e l\u00f3gica\n\u2022 Experi\u00eancia confort\u00e1vel, sem locomo\u00e7\u00e3o\n\u2022 Funciona totalmente offline\n\u2022 Navega\u00e7\u00e3o simples e clara\n\u2022 Ideal para uso individual ou acompanhado\n\nEntre, escolha uma sess\u00e3o e comece imediatamente.", "short_description": "Um ambiente imersivo de realidade virtual com sess\u00f5es guiadas de foco, mem\u00f3ria e l\u00f3gica. Interaja com atividades estruturadas em um espa\u00e7o seguro e confort\u00e1vel, projetado para uso individual ou acompanhado por um instrutor. Funciona offline e oferece uma experi\u00eancia clara e f\u00e1cil de usar desde o primeiro momento."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "en-SQUARE.png", "id": "2455079714926761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825345_2455079721593427_3796230632102004497_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7jxg6aELgy4Q7kNvwEElp5J&_nc_oc=AdpgTfy4CJOINcQAjCVdEPmDsATH6n1JFQj4ijB09Sk07V3g2UEE90S9J_lxhSL499g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2JKnowSUN9qSzYfAxghFPF2xXb-fH05NehKtJCfHsl1A&oe=69F20181"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1807213603280644", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295661_1807213613280643_2773271237489700759_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tc1KN8sRru0Q7kNvwGE-qy-&_nc_oc=Adqo0WqoMvqwNcrOoAS-536eceMgXHQLeLc7FODoS6arVigQouTgVkofbEM4_cWjPOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2nK2Vm5cWjGAnFMo5e61BlYtx3NMpZ7sVr0uHUX5LhfQ&oe=69F2111B"}, {"file_name": "logo.png", "id": "1476182677420290", "image